This project is the generalized machinery of "Fabulous", a private
conversation-archive project built June 2026 by the same authors. The
extractor, redactor, leak guard, sentinel Markdown format, FTS viewer, and
timer guardrails were ported from Fabulous with personal data, memories, and
archive content removed. Licensed under MIT — see LICENSE.

The name honors "50 First Dates" (2004, Columbia Pictures): Lucy's tape is
the morning ritual that lets love outlive amnesia. No affiliation with or
endorsement by the film's rights holders is implied.
